<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE -OCBC 1H NET PROFIT RISES 11.3 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE -OCBC 1H NET PROFIT RISES 11.3 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
